allocation.md la markdown cho NGUOI doc; khong dich vu nao phan tich noi no. He qua:
moi con so cung xuat hien ngoai ma nguon deu la go tay lai, khong truy nguoc duoc ve
luot sinh mang da de ra chung — dung dieu luat cung cua 9Scan-A1 cam.

cung.json khai: xpSupplyCap (binary-constant) · cChainGenesis (do lai duoc bang
eth_getBalance o block 0) · totalSupply (derived, kem cong thuc) · genesisIssued ·
xpGenesisIssued · danh sach dia chi C-Chain kem so du khai.

Moi truong mang theo 'source' cua no. KHONG phai nguon su that — nguon su that la
chain; dich vu doc no phai TU DO roi SO LAI. Xem local-net/faucet/server.mjs /api/supply.

Don vi khai tuong minh ca hai thang: nLOVE9 (9) cho X/P va wei (18) cho C-Chain.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
